@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam dpi 120
title Model/View Interaction (wtq)
actor User
User -> MainWindow : enter query / click Translate
MainWindow -> DataManager : translateRequested(query)
DataManager -> SqlRepository : lookupHistory(query)
SqlRepository --> DataManager : historyResult(found?/result)
alt cache miss
  DataManager -> NetworkManager : requestTranslate(query)
  NetworkManager --> DataManager : translateResponse(json)
  DataManager -> examplesModel : update(...)
  DataManager -> historyModel : append(...)
else cache hit
  DataManager -> historyModel : append(...) (from DB)
end
MainWindow -> historyView : setModel(historyModel or proxy)
MainWindow -> examplesView : setModel(examplesModel)
MainWindow -> commonView : setModel(commonModel)
note right
  Optionally insert QSortFilterProxyModel between models and views\n  for filtering and sorting without modifying source models.
end note
@enduml



